<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '26px 64px 18px 64px', position: 'relative', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 44, height: 620 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 316, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 14, paddingRight: 28, borderRight: '1px solid rgba(15,30,25,0.10)' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#C2410C', letterSpacing: 3 }}>Needs your decision</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F1E19', lineHeight: 1.25 }}>Five decisions<br />before we can move forward</Text>
            <Box style={{ width: 48, height: 3, background: '#C2410C' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#6B7A72', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>These five answers set the route, the budget, and the timeline. Other details can be filled in along the way.</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 18, paddingBottom: 14, borderBottom: '1px solid rgba(15,30,25,0.10)' }}>
                <Text style={{ width: 40, fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C2410C', fontFamily: 'Consolas' }}>01</Text>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 3 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F1E19' }}>Can code and documents leave the internal network?</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#44534C', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>This one directly decides whether we go with cloud Copilot, self-built on Azure, or fully offline self-built (see P07).</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 18, paddingBottom: 14, borderBottom: '1px solid rgba(15,30,25,0.10)' }}>
                <Text style={{ width: 40, fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C2410C', fontFamily: 'Consolas' }}>02</Text>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 3 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F1E19' }}>Do you currently have M365 / E5 licenses?</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#44534C', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>With licenses, the Copilot route could show results within weeks. Without them, it means self-building, and the timeline and cost are completely different.</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 18, paddingBottom: 14, borderBottom: '1px solid rgba(15,30,25,0.10)' }}>
                <Text style={{ width: 40, fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C2410C', fontFamily: 'Consolas' }}>03</Text>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 3 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F1E19' }}>Which identity source should we use?</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#44534C', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>Entra ID, on-premises AD, or another HR system. This decides how permissions connect and how access is cut off immediately when someone leaves.</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 18, paddingBottom: 14, borderBottom: '1px solid rgba(15,30,25,0.10)' }}>
                <Text style={{ width: 40, fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C2410C', fontFamily: 'Consolas' }}>04</Text>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 3 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F1E19' }}>How many environments, and who can touch production?</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#44534C', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>How many Test / UAT / PROD environments, and who gets production access. The more environments, the higher the permission model and operations cost.</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 18 }}>
                <Text style={{ width: 40, fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C2410C', fontFamily: 'Consolas' }}>05</Text>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 3 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F1E19' }}>RPO / RTO, and budget shape</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#44534C', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>How much data can be lost, how quickly service must be restored, and whether it is bought annually or per project. These three answers set the investment in backup and disaster recovery.</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 64, right: 64, bottom: 12, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#6B7A72' }}>SENTINEL · Secure Development Environment Plan</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#6B7A72', fontFamily: 'Consolas' }}>14 / 15</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
